# React Native Performance Rules

- Hermes and New Architecture are the default.
- Run Expo Doctor before native dependency or SDK/RN changes.
- Keep state narrow; avoid inline style objects/arrays/callbacks for memoized children.
- Use memoization after profiling or for stable boundaries.
- Use `FlatList`/`SectionList`; `@shopify/flash-list` only after measurement.
- Keep route files thin and isolate platform-specific code behind platform extensions.
- Batch high-rate real-time updates before they hit React.
